  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Supplementary Studies for Betmai Hydroelectric Project Feasibility Study, through Knight Piesold</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant to Sewa Energy Resources Sociedad Limitada Limited funds supplementary engineering and environmental studies to increase Sierra Leone&apos;s baseload renewable energy through the implementation of a 27-megawatt run-of-river hydroelectric plant at Betmai Falls on the Pampana River in Sierra Leone, for which USTDA already provided a feasibility study. U.S. firm Knight Pisold and Company will carry out the feasibility study on a sole-source basis.</narrative>
  </description>
